# game/ch05.rpy:12
translate english ch5_c9ebcdb5:

    # n "周二晚上，阿狐正在写作业。半年前他上过一个网课，最近网上的传言说那家机构倒闭了。"
    n "Tuesday evening. Ahu was doing homework. Half a year ago he took an online course, and lately rumors said the company had gone under."

# game/ch05.rpy:13
translate english ch5_10983dac:

    # n "突然，一个陌生账号发来好友申请，自称「XX网课客服」。"
    n "Suddenly a stranger sent a friend request, calling itself \"Online Course Support\"."

# game/ch05.rpy:14
translate english ch5_aad03afe:

    # fraud laugh "同学你好！你之前报名的网课因政策调整全面停课，公司现在统一办理学费退费，你那笔1200元学费可以退哦！"
    fraud laugh "Hi there! The course you signed up for has been suspended due to policy changes. The company is now processing tuition refunds — your 1,200 yuan can be refunded!"

# game/ch05.rpy:15
translate english ch5_d586be13:

    # think normal "咦，还有这种好事？那笔学费妈妈提过好几次呢。"
    think normal "Huh, really? Mom has mentioned that tuition more than once."

# game/ch05.rpy:18
translate english ch5_6ccbe9f9:

    # fraud laugh "办理很简单，加入我们的「退费服务群」，按老师指引操作，退费三天到账！"
    fraud laugh "It's simple: join our \"refund service group\" and follow the instructor's steps. The refund arrives in three days!"

# game/ch05.rpy:19
translate english ch5_79edd1aa:

    # fraud serious "本次退费只受理3天，过期视为自动放弃，名额先到先得！"
    fraud serious "Refunds are accepted for 3 days only. After that it counts as a waiver — first come, first served!"

# game/ch05.rpy:33
translate english ch5_A_4866d186:

    # n "阿狐盯着「主动找上门的退费」，心里犯起了嘀咕：机构都倒闭了，谁还这么好心主动退钱？"
    n "Ahu eyed the out-of-the-blue refund suspiciously: if the company went bankrupt, who would be so kind as to refund money on their own?"

# game/ch05.rpy:34
translate english ch5_A_0e4bcc33:

    # think serious "学校反诈课讲过「主动退费」的骗局——越主动送钱的，越要小心！"
    think serious "The anti-fraud class covered \"proactive refund\" scams — the more eagerly someone offers you money, the more careful you should be!"

# game/ch05.rpy:35
translate english ch5_A_ffb1b05e:

    # mc serious "妈妈，有人自称网课客服，说能退1200元学费，让你进群办理，是真的吗？"
    mc serious "Mom, someone claiming to be course support says they can refund my 1,200 yuan tuition if I join a group. Is it real?"

# game/ch05.rpy:36
translate english ch5_A_c42b2b15:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「网课退费」骗局！机构真要退费，会按原报名渠道联系家长，绝不会拉学生进群操作。妈妈明天打官方电话核实。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"course refund\" scam! A real refund comes through the original sign-up channel to parents — never by pulling students into a group. I'll call their official line tomorrow to verify."

# game/ch05.rpy:37
translate english ch5_A_5e514a2b:

    # n "第二天妈妈拨通了官方客服电话——机构运营一切正常，从未有过「退费活动」，这是冒牌客服的骗局。"
    n "The next day Mom called the official hotline — the company was running normally and had never held any \"refund event\". It was a fake-support scam."

# game/ch05.rpy:40
translate english ch5_A_a47c98dc:

    # police laugh "太棒了！「主动退费」是骗子最爱用的诱饵：先冒充客服送钱，再把家长引进假平台收割。主动找上门的「退费」，一律先官方核实！"
    police laugh "Excellent! \"Proactive refunds\" are a scammer's favorite bait: pose as support, promise money, then funnel parents into a fake platform. Always verify refunds through official channels first!"

# game/ch05.rpy:52
translate english ch5_B_a333c232:

    # mc confused "退费直接原路退回不就行了吗？为什么还要进群办理？"
    mc confused "Can't the refund just go back the way it was paid? Why join a group?"

# game/ch05.rpy:53
translate english ch5_B_78feab4d:

    # fraud serious "公司资金清算是特殊流程，必须由「退费专员」统一登记。你看，群里好多同学都退到账了！"
    fraud serious "The company's fund settlement is a special process that must be registered by a \"refund specialist\". See — lots of classmates in the group already got theirs!"

# game/ch05.rpy:54
translate english ch5_B_9648af35:

    # n "对方拉阿狐进群，群里不断有人晒出「退费到账截图」，看起来热热闹闹。"
    n "Ahu was pulled into the group, where people kept posting \"refund received\" screenshots. It looked lively."

# game/ch05.rpy:55
translate english ch5_B_633ada24:

    # fraud laugh "登记后还需下载我们指定的「回款APP」，在上面完成认购任务，本金和退费一起返还，很多家长都在做！"
    fraud laugh "After registering, you'll download our designated \"payout APP\" and complete purchase tasks there — your principal and refund come back together. Lots of parents are doing it!"

# game/ch05.rpy:69
translate english ch5_B1_e8218518:

    # n "阿狐退出群聊，拿着妈妈的手机把聊天记录和截图给妈妈看。"
    n "Ahu left the group and showed Mom the chat log and screenshots on her phone."

# game/ch05.rpy:70
translate english ch5_B1_a033f69d:

    # think worried "群里都说退到账了，可妈妈说过，真退费不该这么麻烦……"
    think worried "Everyone in the group says refunds arrived, but Mom said real refunds shouldn't be this complicated..."

# game/ch05.rpy:71
translate english ch5_B1_4124637a:

    # mc worried "妈妈，这个退费群让我下载APP做认购任务，你看是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, this refund group wants me to download an APP and do purchase tasks. Is it real?"

# game/ch05.rpy:72
translate english ch5_B1_180d7848:

    # mom serious "这是「退费引流」骗局！你看这些「到账截图」，全是批量伪造的。真退费只会原路退回，让你买「理财产品」才能退费的，全是诈骗。"
    mom serious "This is a \"refund funnel\" scam! Those \"received\" screenshots are mass-forged. Real refunds go back the original way — anything asking you to buy \"investment products\" first is fraud."

# game/ch05.rpy:73
translate english ch5_B1_309ece33:

    # n "妈妈带阿狐举报了群和账号，还到原机构官方渠道核实，确认根本没有退费这回事。"
    n "Mom and Ahu reported the group and account, and verified through the original official channel: there was no refund program at all."

# game/ch05.rpy:76
translate english ch5_B1_7920eec5:

    # police laugh "做得好！凡是「先做任务、先买证券」才能退费的，都是把退费当鱼饵的诈骗！求助家长，你就赢了大多数骗子。"
    police laugh "Well done! Any refund that requires \"tasks first\" or \"securities purchases first\" is fraud using refunds as bait! Asking your parents beats most scammers."

# game/ch05.rpy:88
translate english ch5_B2_d6b2ff35:

    # n "阿狐按对方发的链接找了一下，发现这个「回款APP」在手机官方应用商店里根本搜不到，只能从陌生网址下载。"
    n "Ahu checked the link they sent — the \"payout APP\" couldn't be found in the official app store at all; it could only be installed from a strange website."

# game/ch05.rpy:89
translate english ch5_B2_d42b7873:

    # think serious "不对，正规APP都在官方商店，要从陌生网站装的，多半有问题！"
    think serious "Wait — real apps are in the official store. Anything that must be installed from a strange site is probably trouble!"

# game/ch05.rpy:90
translate english ch5_B2_98c5bda8:

    # mc serious "这个APP我不能装。退费请走官方原路退回，不然就算了。"
    mc serious "I'm not installing that APP. Refund me through the original payment channel, or forget it."

# game/ch05.rpy:91
translate english ch5_B2_3f104173:

    # fraud serious "不装APP就无法登记，你的退费名额马上作废，最后一小时了！"
    fraud serious "No APP, no registration — your refund slot is about to expire. One hour left!"

# game/ch05.rpy:92
translate english ch5_B2_c8f7dd83:

    # n "阿狐没有动摇，退出群聊并举报。当晚，群里的「退费同学」全都不见了——那都是骗子的托。"
    n "Ahu stood firm, left the group, and reported it. That evening, all the \"refunded classmates\" vanished — they were the scammer's shills."

# game/ch05.rpy:95
translate english ch5_B2_082bd637:

    # police serious "你识破了「野鸡APP」的套路！非官方渠道的APP，往往内藏木马，专门盗取银行卡信息。能拦住这一步，银行账户就安全了！"
    police serious "You saw through the shady-APP trick! Apps outside official stores often hide trojans that steal bank card details. Stopping at this step keeps your bank account safe!"

# game/ch05.rpy:107
translate english ch5_B3_79160890:

    # n "阿狐下载了陌生APP，用手机号注册，并按提示填写了姓名和身份证号，上传了「收款信息」。"
    n "Ahu downloaded the strange APP, registered with his phone number, and filled in his name, ID number, and \"payout info\" as prompted."

# game/ch05.rpy:108
translate english ch5_B3_c05e4c12:

    # n "刚提交，APP就弹出提示：账户异常，需先缴纳500元「解冻金」才能提现退费。"
    n "Right after submitting, the APP flashed a notice: account abnormal — pay a 500-yuan \"unfreezing fee\" before you can withdraw your refund."

# game/ch05.rpy:109
translate english ch5_B3_e621c0aa:

    # fraud serious "快交解冻金，不然你登记的资金会被冻结，退费作废！"
    fraud serious "Pay the unfreezing fee now, or your registered funds will be frozen and the refund voided!"

# game/ch05.rpy:110
translate english ch5_B3_d8cacb10:

    # think serious "等等！退费哪有反过来交钱的？老师说过，这是骗局！"
    think serious "Wait! Since when does a refund cost the receiver money? Teacher said this is a scam!"

# game/ch05.rpy:111
translate english ch5_B3_cfa0df06:

    # mc serious "我不交了，你们是骗子！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. You're scammers!"

# game/ch05.rpy:112
translate english ch5_B3_91bd6208:

    # n "阿狐卸载APP，把事情告诉妈妈。妈妈第一时间修改了相关密码，并到银行确认了账户安全。"
    n "Ahu uninstalled the APP and told Mom. She immediately changed the related passwords and confirmed the accounts were safe at the bank."

# game/ch05.rpy:115
translate english ch5_B3_f5a5929c:

    # police serious "好险！姓名、身份证号已经泄露，骗子随时可能冒用。记住：要你先交钱的「退费」全是诈骗，身份证号更不能随便填！"
    police serious "That was close! Your name and ID number are already leaked and could be misused at any time. Remember: any \"refund\" that asks you to pay first is fraud, and never hand out your ID number casually!"

# game/ch05.rpy:127
translate english ch5_C_bb1c8350:

    # n "阿狐一心想着帮妈妈拿回学费，立刻申请进群。"
    n "Eager to get Mom's tuition back, Ahu applied to join the group at once."

# game/ch05.rpy:128
translate english ch5_C_5eac39c1:

    # think laugh "退回1200元，妈妈肯定夸我能干！"
    think laugh "If I get the 1,200 yuan back, Mom will surely praise me!"

# game/ch05.rpy:129
translate english ch5_C_c4dfb33f:

    # mc laugh "你好，我要办理退费，怎么操作？"
    mc laugh "Hello, I want my refund. How do I do it?"

# game/ch05.rpy:130
translate english ch5_C_80b15f63:

    # fraud laugh "好嘞！先做一个「新手任务」热热身：认购100元证券，马上返你120元本金加奖励！"
    fraud laugh "Great! Warm up with a \"newbie task\": buy 100 yuan of securities, and get 120 yuan back instantly with a bonus!"

# game/ch05.rpy:131
translate english ch5_C_111017d8:

    # n "阿狐试着转了100元，账户里果然显示「可提现120元」，还能先提现到账！尝到甜头的他更加相信了。"
    n "Ahu tried sending 100 yuan. The account indeed showed \"120 yuan withdrawable\" — and it even let him cash out first! The sweet taste made him believe even more."

# game/ch05.rpy:132
translate english ch5_C_8c2719b8:

    # fraud serious "现在开启「快速退费通道」：完成3000元认购任务，你的1200元退费和本金一起秒到账！"
    fraud serious "Now the \"fast refund channel\" is open: complete a 3,000-yuan purchase task, and your 1,200-yuan refund plus principal arrive in seconds!"

# game/ch05.rpy:146
translate english ch5_C1_6e02722d:

    # n "看着「再交3000」的要求，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Seeing the demand to \"pay another 3,000\", Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch05.rpy:147
translate english ch5_C1_96f12812:

    # think serious "不对！退费是机构把钱还给我，怎么会反过来让我不断交钱？老师说过，先给甜头再收割，就是刷单诈骗的套路！"
    think serious "Wait! A refund means the company gives ME money — why do I keep paying them? Teacher said: sweeten first, harvest later — that's the order-brushing scam playbook!"

# game/ch05.rpy:148
translate english ch5_C1_5f9d5d8c:

    # mc serious "不办了！真退费不会让用户先垫钱，你们是骗子，我要举报你们！"
    mc serious "I'm done! A real refund never makes users pay upfront. You're scammers, and I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch05.rpy:149
translate english ch5_C1_29c8406c:

    # n "阿狐退出群聊、举报账号，把整件事一五一十告诉了妈妈。妈妈立刻向原机构官方渠道核实并报警备案。"
    n "Ahu left the group, reported the account, and told Mom the whole story. She immediately verified with the company's official channel and filed a police report."

# game/ch05.rpy:150
translate english ch5_C1_be937685:

    # mom laugh "你能识破「先甜后刀」的套路，太让妈妈骄傲了！"
    mom laugh "You saw through the \"sweet first, knife later\" trick — Mom is so proud of you!"

# game/ch05.rpy:153
translate english ch5_C1_ac4eb51f:

    # police serious "临「钱」不乱，识破连环套，好样的！记住：所有「做任务才能退费」的，都是披着退费外衣的刷单诈骗！"
    police serious "Calm in front of money and saw through the chain trap — great job! Remember: any \"refund via tasks\" is an order-brushing scam wearing a refund costume!"

# game/ch05.rpy:165
translate english ch5_C2_8b0508e9:

    # n "阿狐舍不得前面的100元，决定再垫500元，凑够「任务进度」。"
    n "Reluctant to lose the 100 yuan already paid, Ahu decided to add 500 more to hit the \"task progress\"."

# game/ch05.rpy:166
translate english ch5_C2_d9d7e112:

    # think laugh "再垫500，说不定3000的任务就能打折完成，退费就到手了。"
    think laugh "Add 500 more — maybe the 3,000 task can be discounted and my refund will land."

# game/ch05.rpy:167
translate english ch5_C2_057cb349:

    # n "500元转过去后，对方却发来新通知：任务金额不足，之前的款项全部冻结，需补齐3000元才能一次性解冻提现。"
    n "After the 500 yuan went through, a new notice arrived: task amount insufficient — all previous payments frozen. You must make up the full 3,000 yuan to unfreeze and withdraw at once."

# game/ch05.rpy:168
translate english ch5_C2_902839ef:

    # mc confused "怎么规则一直在变？说好的退费呢？"
    mc confused "Why do the rules keep changing? Where's my refund?"

# game/ch05.rpy:169
translate english ch5_C2_954c4efa:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈立刻报警。那600元垫付款，早已被骗子转走。"
    n "Ahu told Mom, who reported to the police at once. The 600 yuan had long been transferred away by the scammers."

# game/ch05.rpy:172
translate english ch5_C2_8f487fa9:

    # police serious "骗子的规则永远是「还差一步」！刷单垫资就像无底洞，越填越深。追不回的600元，是给你的深刻一课。"
    police serious "A scammer's rules are always \"one step short\"! Advance payments are a bottomless pit — the more you fill, the deeper it goes. The unrecoverable 600 yuan is a hard lesson."

# game/ch05.rpy:184
translate english ch5_C3_2a9557dd:

    # n "阿狐满心想着拿回1200元退费，把攒了三年的压岁钱3000元全部垫付进去。"
    n "Fixated on getting his 1,200-yuan refund, Ahu put in all 3,000 yuan of the New Year money he'd saved for three years."

# game/ch05.rpy:185
translate english ch5_C3_3c43a58a:

    # n "转账成功，页面却弹出：操作超时，账户冻结，需再缴6000元「解冻金」，否则全部资金没收。"
    n "The transfer succeeded — then the page flashed: operation timed out, account frozen. Pay another 6,000-yuan \"unfreezing fee\" or forfeit everything."

# game/ch05.rpy:186
translate english ch5_C3_379ee49a:

    # n "阿狐慌了，想找「客服」理论——聊天群已被解散，APP无法登录，客服账号拉黑了他。"
    n "Panicked, Ahu looked for \"support\" — the group had been dissolved, the APP wouldn't log in, and the support account had blocked him."

# game/ch05.rpy:187
translate english ch5_C3_583627be:

    # mc sad "我的压岁钱……全没了……妈妈还不知道……"
    mc sad "My New Year money... it's all gone... Mom doesn't know yet..."

# game/ch05.rpy:188
translate english ch5_C3_ef7d6017:

    # n "阿狐哭着向妈妈坦白了一切，妈妈抱了抱他，立刻报警。"
    n "Ahu confessed everything to Mom through tears. She hugged him and called the police right away."

# game/ch05.rpy:189
translate english ch5_C3_f715f2eb:

    # mom normal "钱的事以后一定先告诉妈妈。机构真倒闭了也走法律程序退费，绝不会让你先垫钱。"
    mom normal "Money matters come to Mom first from now on. Even if a company really closes, refunds go through legal procedures — never by you paying upfront."

# game/ch05.rpy:192
translate english ch5_C3_1f5f5c72:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「网课退费」骗局的三板斧：假冒客服送钱、拉群晒假截图、做任务垫资金。凡是让你先交钱才能退费的，百分之百是诈骗！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The \"course refund\" scam has three moves: fake support offers money, a group shows fake screenshots, tasks demand advance payments. Any refund that costs you money first is fraud, one hundred percent!"

